{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024280/extras/d6713ce291d84355d0b294da0c42ecbe.poster.avif?t=1757682961\" width=699 height=32 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024280/extras/d6713ce291d84355d0b294da0c42ecbe.webm?t=1757682961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scour the abandoned corridors of Tasselwood High School. A routine check in the middle of the night turns in to a fatal game of cat-and-mouse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024280/extras/575e1611f5efbe7b102787a7882375c0.webp?t=1757682961\" width=9 height=9 /></span>Why was the school sealed off in such haste?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024280/extras/575e1611f5efbe7b102787a7882375c0.webp?t=1757682961\" width=9 height=9 /></span>What is <i>Project Luminaire</i>? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024280/extras/575e1611f5efbe7b102787a7882375c0.webp?t=1757682961\" width=9 height=9 /></span>Who killed Bethany Carlington?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024280/extras/575e1611f5efbe7b102787a7882375c0.webp?t=1757682961\" width=9 height=9 /></span>And who\u2019s waiting for you in the halls that should\u2019ve been empty?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This demo focuses on the events just hours before the fateful assignment.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024280/extras/72fc3d544058c8a52765e3c2423b8017.webp?t=1757682961\" width=75 height=24 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; Puzzles</strong> <br>Search classrooms, offices, and ruined corridors for clues. The building itself resists you - collapsing elements, locked doors, and fragments of a story hidden in forgotten corners.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-Linear Storytelling</strong> <br>Multiple paths, multiple endings. Environmental storytelling leads you forward, but the truth won\u2019t be handed to you. Optional secrets reveal answers you weren\u2019t even asking for.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunted in the Dark</strong> <br>You\u2019re not alone. Keep your flashlight close - the shadows are watching, and they move when you don\u2019t.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024280/extras/02d6a4e5a75aac0f029a98f66ecee328.webp?t=1757682961\" width=96 height=24 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No saves - immersion is survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Headphones recommended for full impact</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This psychological horror game deals with heavy themes which may be upsetting. Play at your own discretion.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4024280?t=1757682961","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024280/991ff941b23b24b90679fe9d4b0247e8cdb7abee/page_bg_raw.j